# ==============================================================================
# condor_train_fullrange.sub
# CRMHD-TBNN training over the FULL dns_khi time range, with per-snapshot
# L_tensor floors.
#
# Why this run exists
# -------------------
# The previous model (checkpoints/best_model.pt) was trained on t in [1, 6.4]
# while the rollout it is judged on runs to t = 20 -- the defaults predate the
# DNS being extended past t = 8. Measured on clean filtered DNS, its stress is
# fine to t ~ 12 and then collapses: by t = 20 it has 40% of the right
# amplitude, 19% of the right high-k content (against 49% for the exact stress)
# and delivers 11% of the true energy transfer. That is why the rollout's
# high-k band ratio decays to 0.12 while the exact-DNS oracle holds 0.33.
#
# Two coupled changes, which have to go together:
#   1. --time-range 1.0 20.0     : train on the regime the rollout explores.
#   2. --tensor-floor-scope snapshot : L_tensor normalises by
#      ||tau_DNS||^2 + floor^2, and ||tau||_F varies ~40x across t = 0..20. One
#      global floor puts every cell of the weak snapshots below it, where the
#      term degenerates to an absolute MSE and predicting zero is near-optimal.
#      Extending the window with a global floor would make the collapse worse,
#      not better.
#
# No internal test window: with training over the whole run there is no later
# time to hold out, so the honest test is the independent realisation being
# generated into dns_khi_s1/ (different seed). Evaluate against that, not
# against a band of this run.
#
# loss-beta is left at its default 0.1 so this is a single coherent change
# against the previous model; raise it only after measuring what this run does
# to the tau high-k deficit (38% vs 51% for the exact stress).
# ==============================================================================

universe       = vanilla
executable     = ./run_train.sh

# <data_dir> <r> <stride> <epochs> <snapshots_per_batch> <lr> <device> <plot_interval> [patience] [extra...]
arguments      = "dns_khi_s1 16 1 2500 2 1e-4 cuda 10 200 --time-range 1.0 20.0 --test-time 0 0 --tensor-floor-scope snapshot --resume --reset-lr --reset-best"

environment    = "CHECKPOINT_DIR=checkpoints_fullrange"

output         = ./condor_logs/train_fr_$(Cluster)_$(Process).out
error          = ./condor_logs/train_fr_$(Cluster)_$(Process).err
log            = ./condor_logs/train_fr_$(Cluster)_$(Process).log

getenv         = True

request_cpus   = 8
request_memory = 32768
request_gpus   = 1

#+UseNvidiaA100 = True

queue 1
